'''Yol†''', ''n.'' An obsolete variant of ''Yule.''

'''yold†.''' An obsolete preterit and past participle of ''yield.''

'''yolden†''', ''p. a.'' [Obs. pp. of ''yield.''] Yielded; surrendered; submissive.
{{smaller block|With loke doun cast and humble i-''yolden'' chere.
